  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# v1.1.0\nVersion 1.1.0 introduces optional main commands with getopt-style subcommands.\n\n## Changes\n - Added optional main commands with command-specific long and short options\n - Added selected-command state without changing the existing `GetNextOpt` contract\n - Added opt-in culture-independent case-insensitive matching\n - Added spelling suggestions and command-specific exceptions\n - Added command-aware help generation and tests",
